<title>UK: BZW sets warrants on Volvo.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on Volvo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants has issued six million American-style call warrants, on Volvo B shares, lead manager BZW Securities said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    215 SEK		   ISSUE PRICE  33.4 SEK</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	28.JAN.99		 PAYDATE	18.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  215 SEK</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE    BZEI</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
